# Build context filter for deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to
# the Dockerfile). Allow-list: only what the image needs is sent to the builder, so the
# virtualenv, contract build output, .env files and .holdup/ credentials stay out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!holdup/
!fixtures/
!res/
!deploy/requirements-uv.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
